  "excerpt": "QEI invites early career optometrists to an exciting evening of retina education.",
  "body_html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Collect CPD points at a riverside dinner symposium</h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #1b75bc;\">Retina by the river</span></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Wednesday, 2nd September 2026</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"></div>\n<p class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"Optometry Australia Institute of Excellence Quality Assured 3Ti\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-6783\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"220\" id=\"longdesc-return-6783\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6783&amp;referrer=6742\" sizes=\"(max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/07/3Ti-175x300.jpg\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/07/3Ti-175x300.jpg 175w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/07/3Ti.jpg 375w\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"128\"/>Associate Professors Anthony Kwan and Abhishek Sharma and Dr Alexander Newman explore the <strong>latest advances in retinal eye disease</strong> including diagnosis, management and shared care.<br/>\n<img alt=\"Sign saying 'sorry registration closed'\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-6221 size-medium\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"259\" id=\"longdesc-return-6221\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6221&amp;referrer=6465\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-348x300.png 348w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed.png 500w\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"300\"/></p>\n<p> </p>",
  "details_html": "<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Wednesday, 2nd September 2026</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">6:00 pm – 8:30 pm</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Otto Ristorante<br/>\nRiver Quay Green Southbank</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/qe9UaXiCVtNxkaKX9\">View map</a></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">🍽️Dinner and drinks provided</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Numbers are strictly limited and registration is essential to secure your place.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Sign saying 'sorry registration closed'\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-6221 size-medium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"259\" id=\"longdesc-return-6221\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6221&amp;referrer=6740\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-348x300.png 348w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed.png 500w\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"300\"/></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">All enquiries to Tina Huynh at <a href=\"mailto:education@qei.org.au\">education@qei.org.au</a></p>",
